'''Chiseled sulfur''' is a decorative [[chiseled]] variant of [[sulfur]] used for building.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Chiseled sulfur drops as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{Breaking row|Chiseled Sulfur|Pickaxe|horizontal=1}}

