== Usage ==
Chiseled sulfur is used primarily for decoration.

=== Sulfur cube ===
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb chiseled sulfur, either through picking it up or being interacted with it. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

